to make a broader argument that isn't necessarily accurate

01:23:21.100 --> 01:23:22.770
outside of Australia.

01:23:22.770 --> 01:23:23.603
Yeah, exactly.

01:23:23.603 --> 01:23:24.570
The mouse plague argument.

